  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Enhance Climate and Financial Resilience in Barbados</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para Potenciar la Resiliencia Climtica y Financiera en Barbados</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Objetivo General de Desarrollo (OGD) del programa es mejorar la resiliencia climtica y financiera en Barbados. Los Objetivos Especficos de Desarrollo (OED) son: (i) fortalecer el marco institucional para apoyar las finanzas sostenibles e inversiones en resiliencia climtica y hdrica; y (ii) mejorar la capacidad de gestin fiscal para aumentar la resiliencia fiscal y ante el Cambio Climtico (CC).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The General Development Objective (GDO) of the program is to enhance climate and financial resilience in Barbados. The Specific Development Objectives (SDO) are: (i) strengthening the institutional framework to support sustainable finance and investments in climate and water resilience; and (ii) improving fiscal management capacity to increase fiscal and Climate Change (CC) resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
